<title>USA: U.S. business loans rose $900 mln in Oct 23 week.</title>
<headline>U.S. business loans rose $900 mln in Oct 23 week.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commercial and industrial loans on the books of U.S. commercial banks rose $900 million to $768.6 billion in the week ended Oct 23, the Federal Reserve said Friday.</p>
</text>
